\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(214, 214, 214);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           El Conacaste位于上图左上角Santa Ana区域顶部\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           关于巨树庄园\n          </span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           巨树庄园位于萨尔瓦多的生物多样性丰饶的特里菲尼奥地区，与壮丽的蒙特克里斯托国家公园优雅接壤。庄园坐拥一片迷人的土地\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          ，海拔从1,000米起步，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          逐渐攀升至1,800米。在1,400米至1,800米的海拔区间，有养分充沛的原始土壤与独特的小气候，这些因素深刻塑造了巨树咖啡豆复杂而卓尔不群的风味图谱。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RltOP7NZvbSROv0gyH1auIXX0fVnD52paOOBInWtEkK4vgCDKngU75rcywYXKM5hickAicaroibAb1Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          最初的El Conacaste并非一片咖啡园,早在1996年由\n         </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Piero Antonio Rusconi Gutierrez\n         </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          购入这片210公顷土地的初衷，是为了实施一项重新造林计划—通过植树与保育行动，修复并重焕这片区域的自然生态系统；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RltOP7NZvbSROv0gyH1auIAUhkic9JSMXoJFvAETOibiaRoA4Sib4LI6RvxRuejBiaG0ew0YMT1kWV7jw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RltOP7NZvbSROv0gyH1auI0qRH4VrOUl0EthxJKjm2wvz0ibtWGVxMZGWErcl2S2QTJpxWxicicSNtA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RltOP7NZvbSROv0gyH1auIuf3syRdRHVLgR3t1l4DdrP95dOnwhzxglicF7iaCEwPgcwiaHzN7hrogw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RltOP7NZvbSROv0gyH1auI8MAbibZby0LtQHyGlGdvFIjv6n8icAEfjPBcUgGb3Zg7NWXhAJmsiabRA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          经历了育苗，修路，建造屋舍，2010年，生态已经完全恢复到一个可以自给自足的健康状况下，庄园开始用长大的树木木材来搭建暖棚，开始种植草莓和蔬菜等；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RltOP7NZvbSROv0gyH1auIwib3LlXdUibXXia4PKAM2ib8nMyF9ToZ8qlMCvNUqHbEeohR6DNQEdypGw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RltOP7NZvbSROv0gyH1auIx97y8bAxPvxTph2vyFzPDPUsMxnyUiaic7zqXmfJibuf60Q4Oibj0OFkxg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          直到2014年，庄园第一次开始育苗咖啡，2017年开始有咖啡的产出，2021年萨尔瓦多CoE\n          <a class=\"wx_topic_link\" data-topic=\"1\" style=\"color: #576B95 !important;\" topic-id=\"mjl6dhyx-g7hthj\">\n           #2\n          </a>\n          ，2022年萨尔瓦多CoE\n          <a class=\"wx_topic_link\" data-topic=\"1\" style=\"color: #576B95 !important;\" topic-id=\"mjl6dn0g-qsbgmw\">\n           #1\n          </a>\n          ，2023年庄园开启了自己的庄园私有竞拍；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RltOP7NZvbSROv0gyH1auIPxzdlawTqd3C6XCKpwN5c4TyNwNN5rxMF4526M0gCy5Ia2DDvafgWQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RltOP7NZvbSROv0gyH1auIxHrYqNmibnfLeEwXeN5LIJpT0p6CGPNbg4dG4icvl6jfagDx8D0swgJw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RltOP7NZvbSROv0gyH1auIjjsVXicnQIQ0FawSwiahLpBcOuBefdS1fYRjia1xy9jr7cNfF7X2fHOiaQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          这个成长的历程和成绩是非常的罕见的，就是一声不吭的种植加工，然后就有了很好质量的豆子，但是中间的所有的历程都是非常扎实和朝着质量的方向去控制管理的；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RltOP7NZvbSROv0gyH1auIL2qS7Ss7AVVx7icbJyquDmBVINXMzc37xiatMSYwaKaTPfGLdjhA30pw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n           获奖记录\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          2025 CoE\n          <a class=\"wx_topic_link\" data-topic=\"1\" style=\"color: #576B95 !important;\" topic-id=\"mjl7p53e-xh0p4b\">\n           #3\n          </a>\n          日晒组 （Gesha）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          2022 CoE\n          <a class=\"wx_topic_link\" data-topic=\"1\" style=\"color: #576B95 !important;\" topic-id=\"mjl7p53e-ub66mv\">\n           #1\n          </a>\n          （Gesha Natural）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          2021 CoE\n          <a class=\"wx_topic_link\" data-topic=\"1\" style=\"color: #576B95 !important;\" topic-id=\"mjl7p53e-ed13wu\">\n           #2\n          </a>\n</span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          （Gesha Natural）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: